", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210884_988670664993027_3401519494358859447_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=a8PBZXd8NMMQ7kNvwGnqH_U&_nc_oc=AdrNIinW3zP3G9FxEsJW7-Bgxauy_GMItHI3FSNfdhNOcPIyeXtNWiNcYiB3P8GAdvA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRckI-AXcoUvEq4sala2iKXesgz-5MLd85r1zJko1MNVA&oe=6AFB3687"}, {"file_name": "delete me 1 .png", "id": "172355680988904", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974479_172355684322237_4105130526410975147_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-bEdjTR1hnEQ7kNvwFNMyiM&_nc_oc=AdrAz-YWSWLoBK0-FiTFSNJq2bh_fHk5pWVeoWN7EzJlGDTJD8wOFtMUDzBsazqVz84&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSqpLmUcU7ylwFLMnrjwSaY0NYKYX2V0Ot1wRUM8HE-Ow&oe=6AFB1D99"}, {"file_name": "delete me 4.png", "id": "158877452514842", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75422392_158877455848175_4048704126648886678_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mg3RV7YN6DEQ7kNvwGOYWi7&_nc_oc=AdogVRwrrToV58oYk9P4gERwqga6QEkNmqUnhEt2UOslnTOpPsvC4RDblHXsHIVusR0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSWci3fJBJX8tsTFbvwZ-RFC0o_8C6rYTXU3yjKmST05A&oe=6AFB230B"}, {"file_name": "delete me.png", "id": "138116401478547", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75462963_138116404811880_7726014392190288933_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ITOvY4U9REMQ7kNvwGZeenP&_nc_oc=AdpHfIALWAuzeR2XdUJlFYN7JX_2r17WVl6lpoHqSB2emfeUkn5sbRd-K3PuQFiH-s4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSxhHW1dxZKGnxJssOVh__YM0Z9m8CxQGmsFkPk8ulV1w&oe=6AFB291E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "delette me 6.png", "id": "462900904730118", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57570311_462900908063451_1017078218521890310_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=K_obzCmy_MgQ7kNvwGuj2F-&_nc_oc=AdqukjCX7NBawRmUs8uHut3DYyZwgz3SB0Rjk9f4vPzPFq_bxT_5dxUraJ41MVdRQ7g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRYOBwUzjcGN-ZcjN6_xgqfmWWtffGv1wXN3-ECPySzBg&oe=6AFB38E5"}, "display_name": "Healium", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Beautiful, nature-based escapes powered by your imagination. Float through a crystal forest, feel a healing rain wash over you, or sit quietly in a field of sunflowers. Virtually travel to Mauii, listen to the rustle of a bamboo forest and the ocean waves lapping at your feet. Experience different colors of healing, trace a mandalynth, or glide through a breath-taking fractal. Use your feelings of focused calm to make the flurries fly inside a magic snow globe. Sit quietly inside a zen garden. Grow leaves on a 150-year-old Burr Oak tree with your memories of being still. Healium is a walk in the park for those times when you can't physically take a walk in the park. In four peer-reviewed journals, Healium has been shown to improve mood in as little as four minutes. Connect an optional EEG meditation headband to make a firefly rise and fall with your feelings. Healium is a reminder that our thoughts have power to control things not only in the virtual world but the real world as well.", "short_description": "Beautiful, nature-based escapes powered by your imagination.  Float through a crystal forest, feel a healing rain wash over you, or sit quietly in a field of sunflowers. Virtually travel to Mauii, listen to the rustle of a bamboo forest and the ocean waves lapping at your feet. Experience different colors of healing, trace a mandalynth, or glide through a breath-taking fractal. Healium is a walk in the park for those times when you can't physically take a walk in the park. "}]}, "developer_name": "Healium", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.tryhealium.com/privacy-policy/", "devel